            <div class="qtype-coded">500-1,000 employees</div>
          </div>
          <div class="qtype-method">
            <strong>Method:</strong> Directed content analysis (Hsieh &amp; Shannon, 2005). Predefined categories with clear boundaries.
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Categorical -->
        <div class="qtype-card">
          <div class="qtype-icon qtype-icon-cat">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
