            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td><code class="inline-code">codebook.json</code></td>
                <td>The canonical codebook built by discovery: global themes, per-question applicability, question-specific additions, and coverage gap notes. Phase 6 appends a <code class="inline-code">dimensions</code> section classifying themes as basis, criterion, or descriptor.</td>
                <td>Review themes and dimensions before application runs (human review gate)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><code class="inline-code">final_codes.json</code></td>
                <td>Canonical coded output: thematic codes AND direction (+/-/~) per meaning unit, written by <code class="inline-code">run_coding.py</code></td>
